# state: first-run   (recorded on a disk with no save for the title (NOTES.md E); lane.savestate433)
# Tork: Prehistoric Punk (55530040), Nova and Thor. DRAFT by lane.routeprep,
# 2026-09-26, not played. One file: New Game does not need a save; a save
# prompt, if any, is accepted with A.
#
# Evidence: gamecheck hands-off 240 s (1790365218-gamecheck-415427, Nova,
# ~2.4 s per frame): f05 Ubisoft, f10-f22 the TORK title with "Press START"
# (~25-55 s), then, left alone, f26 a TORK logo over the sky and an
# in-engine cinematic running at 1-4 fps (village, a bird, Tork's face),
# and by f90-f98 a top-down shot of Tork lying in a clearing. Whether that
# cinematic is the attract or the game's intro is not known. Nothing past
# "Press START" is on disk.
#
# Adopted by lane.titleroutes 2026-09-30 (session 42) unchanged in its steps
# except where noted, and queued as a Thor screening soak (<= 480 s, the
# fan-dead Thor's cold-slot runner): NOT YET REPLAYED. Every step leaves a
# frame, so a soak that misses gameplay is the survey that revises it.
wait 30
shot boot30                 # expect the TORK title, "Press START" [seen f10-f22]
press START
wait 6
shot after-title            # [guess] New Game / Load / Options
mark booted
press A                     # [guess] New Game
wait 8
shot after-new-game         # OPEN: a save slot / difficulty prompt
press A
wait 10
shot intro
# [guess] the intro cinematic; it ran at 1-4 fps in gamecheck, so it may take
# minutes. A is tried; START is not (it would pause gameplay).
repeat 10 {                 # was 12: the heat stop
    press A
    wait 8
    shot intro-a
}
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame with Tork walking under the stick
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    press X                 # [guess] club
    wait 0.4
    press A                 # [guess] jump
    wait 0.6
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    wait 1
    press X
    wait 0.4
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
}
